# Sustainable Fashion Interview Plan<br>
<br>
## Research Questions:<br>
<br>
* What are the current challenges in implementing sustainable production methods?<br>
* How do designers and manufacturers balance sustainability with cost-effectiveness?<br>
* Are there any innovative materials or technologies being used in sustainable fashion?<br>
<br>
## Potential Interviewees:<br>
<br>
* Local designers who specialize in sustainable fashion<br>
* Manufacturers who have implemented sustainable practices in their supply chain<br>
* Industry experts who can provide insights on the latest trends and challenges<br>
<br>
## Timeline:<br>
<br>
* Week 1-2: Research potential interviewees and create a list of questions<br>
* Week 3-4: Conduct interviews with designers and manufacturers<br>
* Week 5: Analyze results and write up findings<br>
```<br>
